                                "sense_id": "7bfbc4f1-f30b-386b-a2d3-5fcf312d248c",
                                "text": "After some remonstrances, she takes up a champagne bottle, but is frightened by the sudden explosion of the cork, and drops it upon the floor. There the untasted liquor effervesces."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8ca1cd2-eeaa-3fb3-a351-4bb13c69fa0f",
